<!--
  RightClicksShellExtension - Windows Explorer Context Menu Extension

  ⚠️ CRITICAL: THIS PROJECT MUST REMAIN .NET FRAMEWORK 4.8 ⚠️

  This DLL is a COM server that gets loaded DIRECTLY INTO explorer.exe.
  Windows Explorer is a native 64-bit process that can ONLY host .NET Framework assemblies.
  .NET 8 / .NET Core / .NET 5+ assemblies CANNOT be loaded by Explorer.

  This is a Windows limitation that cannot be changed.

  DEPENDENCIES MUST ALSO BE .NET FRAMEWORK COMPATIBLE:
  - SharpShell.dll - Shell extension framework (.NET Framework)
  - Newtonsoft.Json.dll - Must be the .NET Framework version, NOT the .NET 8 version

  If the wrong Newtonsoft.Json.dll is used, you'll see:
  "Could not load file or assembly 'System.Runtime, Version=6.0.0.0'"

  See CLAUDE.md "⚠️ CRITICAL: .NET Version Compatibility" section for full details.
-->
